msgid "Same-day priority cutoff has passed — next-day priority available"
msgstr ""
"Крайният час за приоритет в същия ден е минал — налично е приоритетно "
"изпълнение за следващия ден"

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:254
msgid ""
"⚡ Skip the line — add Priority Processing and get your order moving before "
"everyone else's."
msgstr ""
"⚡ Пропусни опашката — добави Priority Processing и изпрати поръчката си "
"преди всички останали."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:255
msgid "🚀 Time is money. Priority Processing means days less waiting."
msgstr "🚀 Времето е пари. С Priority Processing чакаш с дни по-малко."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:256
msgid ""
"📦 Your order could be on its way faster — just add Priority Processing."
msgstr ""
"📦 Поръчката ти може да потегли по-бързо — просто добави Priority Processing."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:257
msgid "🔥 Priority customers get their orders out about 2x faster on average."
msgstr ""
"🔥 Клиентите с приоритет получават поръчките си средно 2 пъти по-бързо."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:258
msgid "🎯 Need it now, not next week? Priority Processing is for you."
msgstr "🎯 Трябва ти сега, а не другата седмица? Priority Processing е за теб."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:259
msgid ""
"⏱ Every minute you wait is a minute you didn't have to. Speed things up with"
" one click."
msgstr "⏱ Всяка минута чакане е излишна. Ускори нещата само с едно кликване."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:273
msgid ""
"⚡ In a hurry for this one? Add Priority Processing at checkout and get it "
"first."
msgstr ""
"⚡ Бързаш за този продукт? Добави Priority Processing при поръчката и го "
"получи първи."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:274
msgid "🚀 Don't want to wait? Turn on Priority Processing on the next step."
msgstr "🚀 Не искаш да чакаш? Включи Priority Processing на следващата стъпка."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:275
msgid ""
"🎁 This item is in high demand — Priority Processing helps make sure it "
"reaches you faster."
msgstr ""
"🎁 Този продукт е много търсен — Priority Processing помага да стигне до теб "
"по-бързо."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:276
msgid "🏆 Our VIP customers choose Priority Processing. Why not you?"
msgstr "🏆 Нашите VIP клиенти избират Priority Processing. Защо не и ти?"

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:277
msgid "📦 Ready to ship the moment you order — with Priority Processing."
msgstr "📦 Готов за изпращане веднага след поръчката — с Priority Processing."

#: includes/frontend/messages.php:278
msgid ""
"⏳ Every extra day of waiting is a day too many. Speed it up with Priority "
"Processing."
msgstr ""
"⏳ Всеки допълнителен ден чакане е излишен. Ускори с Priority Processing."

#: woocommerce-priority-processing.php:295
msgid ""
"WooCommerce Priority Processing requires WooCommerce to be installed and "
"active."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce Priority Processing изисква WooCommerce да е инсталиран и "
"активен."

#~ msgid "⚡ Priority processing added by %s. Fee: %s"
#~ msgstr "⚡ Priority Processing добавен от %s. Такса: %s"
